Package: deliverygap
Title: Delivery SLA Gap Analysis in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Nagaraj", "Gireppa Kanni", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Statistical root-cause analysis of late deliveries on the DataCo supply chain dataset:
    chi-square tests with Cramer's V, logistic regression with holdout AUC, p-charts, goodness-of-fit
    tests, and a promise-setting recommendation, rendered as an R Markdown report.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: data.table, ggplot2, scales, knitr, rmarkdown
Suggests: testthat
